  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あープロデューサー。おはようございまーす\r\nテレビとテーブル借りてるよ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "って、あれ。アイドルの動画か……？\r\n珍しいな、ここで見てるなんて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "んー\r\n敵情視察って言えばそんなに変でもないかと思って",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "趣味ではなく、これは研究\r\nちゃんと擬態できるようにはしてますよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なるほど。『G.R.A.D.』に出る子たちか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそう\r\nだから見てるわけだけど──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "とはいえ、三峰の最近のおすすめちゃんたちだってのも\r\n事実なので？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まぁ一石二鳥かな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、結華らしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもよく調べたな\r\nノートとかもまとまってるし──",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ああっ、こらこら！\r\nそっちの中を見るのは許可してませんから！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "勝手に見ない、プライバシーよろしく！\r\nおっけー？！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん、つい……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も後で手元の情報送るよ\r\n……大体もう知ってそうだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "問題ないない",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "推しの情報はすべてキャッチしておきたいので\r\nなんでも一旦三峰に投げちゃってくださいな～",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、了解だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0772",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 5000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あ、今の子。いい動きするな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っ！　えっ、プロデューサー！\r\nわかる！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰もその子がすごいなって思ってて！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そう！　あのねっ、無邪気で可愛い感じに見えて、\r\nここぞってところを外さない勘があるっていうか！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "画面に映るとぱっと華やかになるし、\r\nあとほら自分の撮らせ方が上手くて──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもこれ多分本人は無意識なんだよ！\r\nそういうの、才能、って感じがして最高じゃない……！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、確かに\r\n結華が言いたいことはわかる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でしょ！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "めちゃめちゃいいからさ、\r\n『G.R.A.D.』の時も結構要注意だと思ってて",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "研究っていうか、対策っていうか\r\nそういうの考えとかなきゃって思ってるんだけど！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサー、何か意見があったら──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ……\r\nいや──そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、結華の敵じゃないと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "────は？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger_strong",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_strong",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、相手を知っておくのは大事なことだけど\r\n必要以上に気にする相手じゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それが、俺の意見だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……それ、この子のこと軽んじてない？\r\n三峰なんてまだまだなんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_strong",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、軽んじてはいない\r\n実力がある子だと思ったうえで言ってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "どうだか。時期も時期だし、\r\n三峰のこと持ち上げようとしたんじゃないの？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そういうの、逆に冷めるけど──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なぁ、結華",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……何",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger_strong",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_strong",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そういうふうに言うんなら、結華の方こそ、だ\r\n軽んじるのはやめてほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今結華が悪く言ったのは、うちの自慢のアイドルだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……\r\n──────",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_strong",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "autoWaitTime": 2000,
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003020270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "って、なっ──",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700302/1007003020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、以上が俺の意見だよ\r\n何かあれば聞くけど──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
